Whatever Quavo said here is exactly the same thing he said in verse on Menace;

When he said, “Let’s get it (Let’s go)
[?] we stackin' these racks to the ceilin' (Woo)”

They’ve got all kinds of drugs :


“Gas”, which is slang for good Weed;
“Molly”, a white powder or crystal form of MDMA.
“Lean”, which is prescription cough syrup mixed with a soda (Sprite is the most popular option) It is also known as “Sizzurp” “Purple Drank” etc;
Pills – Ecstasy, not to be confused with “Molly”, the most obvious difference is Molly is in powder or crystal form, and Ecstasy is in pill or capsule form of MDMA.



They also have a lot of money on them.

Ricky racks is one of the producers of the song “What The Price”,the 8th song of the early 2017 album “CULTURE”.
